             agml_phiz
      COMMON /agml_vars/ agml_rotm, agml_thetax, agml_phix, agml_thetay, agml_phiy,
             agml_thetaz, agml_phiz
      Author JBouchet,FVidebaek
      Created 11/07 2013
      +CDE,agecom,gcunit,gconst..
      CONTENT PXMO,
      PXLA,
      PXCA, PXCC, PXCD, PXCE, PXCF, PXCG, PXCH, PXCB,
      PXRB, PXTR, PXTM, PXTL, PXTJ, PXTI, PXLB, PXIB,
