      real *4 backingZOffset/0.00/

      real *4 DoveTailExtrusionLength/0.05/

      real *4 DoveTailExtrusionThickness/0.124/

      real *4 DoveTailExtrusionThicknessBox/0.262/

      real *4 DoveTailExtrusionThicknessNeg/-0.124/

      real *4 DoveTailExtrusionHalfThickness/0.062/

